      <title>Rob Fowler receives first Kiwanis Legacy Award</title>
      <link>https://www.covnews.com/community/rob-fowler-receives-first-kiwanis-legacy-award/</link>
      <description>At its regular weekly meeting on Feb. 26, the Kiwanis Club of Covington presented the first Covington Kiwanis Legacy Award to Rob Fowler, a Kiwanis member since 1969. The purpose of the award is to recognize a Covington Kiwanian for long-term service to the community.</description>
